@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava korisnice Ana
# @name ana
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@dermawise.rs", "password": "user123"}

### Upitnik koji je seeder sačuvao: uvek opekotine i slaba preplanulost, papule na čelu, obrazima, bradi i grudima
GET {{host}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}

### FC primer 1: fototip II i MED 30, GAGS 23 i MODERATE, adapalen + BP, pa BP ujutru i adapalen uveče (vidi explanation)
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}

### Prijava korisnice Milica (trudna)
# @name milica
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "milica@dermawise.rs", "password": "user123"}

### Isti lanac uz trudnoću: adapalen povučen (notInRoutine), azelainska kiselina 15% čeka dermatologa, napomena u safetyNotes
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{milica.response.body.token}}

### Poslednja analiza se čita iz baze sa trenutnim statusima preporuka
GET {{host}}/api/analysis/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{milica.response.body.token}}
